# The test command for this repo, read by review-and-push.sh step 2 (#490):
# the first line that is not blank and not a comment. REVIEW_TEST_CMD overrides
# it; `claude/scripts/run-tests.sh` with no flags runs every suite.
#
# --changed, not the full run: all 48 suites measured 919s (15.3 min) on a
# developer machine, which is too long to sit in front of every push. --changed
# maps the branch's diff to the suites that can be affected and widens to all of
# them whenever the mapping is unsure, and CI runs every suite on the PR
# regardless — so the narrow run is never the only run.
claude/scripts/run-tests.sh --changed
